1
00:00:00,096 --> 00:00:01,266
[LAUGH ING]

2
00:00:01,431 --> 00:00:02,851
(Raj:)My turn.

3
00:00:03,475 --> 00:00:07,315
(Penny(entering):)Okay, first of all, what you call a gap
was nearly three feet wide.

4
00:00:07,479 --> 00:00:09,439
(Penny(entering):)- I slipped and skinned my knee.
- Are you okay?

5
00:00:09,606 --> 00:00:10,646
[BUZZING]

6
00:00:10,815 --> 00:00:13,445
(Penny:)The door to the stairwell
of the other building was locked.

7
00:00:13,610 --> 00:00:16,320
(Penny:)I had to go down the fire escape,
which ends on the third floor...

8
00:00:16,488 --> 00:00:19,408
(Penny:)...forcing me to crawl through the window
of a lovely Armenian family...

9
00:00:19,574 --> 00:00:21,994
(Penny:)...who insisted I stay for lunch.

10
00:00:22,661 --> 00:00:23,951
(Leonard:)That doesn't sound too bad.

11
00:00:24,120 --> 00:00:28,330
(Penny:)It was eight courses of lamb.
And they tried to fix me up with their son.

12
00:00:29,960 --> 00:00:31,130
(Penny:)- Sorry.
- Not done.

13
00:00:31,294 --> 00:00:33,964
By the time I got to work,
they'd given my shift away.

14
00:00:34,130 --> 00:00:37,470
(Penny:)Yeah, that's right.
I've lost an entire day's pay thanks to this.

15
00:00:37,634 --> 00:00:39,304
(Sheldon:)- This...
- Time machine.

16
00:00:42,722 --> 00:00:44,602
(Leonard:)The lights flash and the dish spins.
Wanna try?

17
00:00:44,766 --> 00:00:46,056
(Sheldon:)No.

18
00:00:46,810 --> 00:00:50,230
I don't wanna try it.
My God, you are grown men.

19
00:00:50,397 --> 00:00:53,107
How can you waste your lives
with these stupid toys...

20
00:00:53,275 --> 00:00:56,195
(Penny:)...and costumes and comic books,
and now that?

21
00:00:56,361 --> 00:01:00,021
(Raj:)- That...
- Again, time machine.

